OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested as drugs worth #2.4
OL,4,Amillion seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuspected drugs worth #2.4m were seized
OL,7,Fby detectives, following the search of
OL,8,Fa vehicle in Lisburn on Tuesday.
OL,10,FA man in his 40s has been arrested on
OL,11,Fsuspicion of a number of offences.
OL,13,FThe drugs were found after police
OL,14,Fofficers on patrol stopped a suspicious
OL,15,Fvehicle in the Hillsborough Road area
OL,16,Fof the city at around 21:15 BST.
OL,18,FDetective Sergeant Martin said:: "The
OL,19,Fvan was subsequently searched and
OL,20,Fapproximately 20kg of suspected cocaine
OL,21,Fwas recovered."
